    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Stack cards</strong></u> \ud83c\udccf\u200b to collect food, craft equipment, build structures and defeat the dungeon \u2694\ufe0f\u200b in this village builder roguelite. Discover new cards, gather new resources and craft new recipes every run! Combine, survive\u200b and thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u> \u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udccf 300+ cards to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udf33 10 biomes to unlock &amp; explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc7f 9 dungeons &amp; 3 difficulties to defeat\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u2694\ufe0f 50+ enemies to fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore biomes</strong></u> \ud83c\udf33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biome cards are the main source of resources each run. To start a new run you need to select which biomes you want to use. Explore them to find unique resources and customize your build the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Craft new resources</strong></u> \ud83d\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards to craft all kinds of new resources, equipment and structures to help you settle your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survive</strong></u> \ud83c\udf4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your people have a hunger meter. Establish a nice food production to keep that bar high, otherwise they will perish from starvation. \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight enemies</strong></u> \u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To start a new run you also need to select which dungeon/difficulty you want to play against. They will spawn all kinds of enemies in a wave based system, all depending on which difficulty you choose. Take them down, settle your people and unlock new cards to help you on your next run! All that while enjoying a soothing art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Stack cards</strong></u> \ud83c\udccf\u200b to collect food, craft equipment, build structures and defeat the dungeon \u2694\ufe0f\u200b in this village builder roguelite. Discover new cards, gather new resources and craft new recipes every run! Combine, survive\u200b and thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u> \u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udccf 300+ cards to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udf33 10 biomes to unlock &amp; explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc7f 9 dungeons &amp; 3 difficulties to defeat\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u2694\ufe0f 50+ enemies to fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/7b3f2bcea88616cf5455c8ca802366de.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore biomes</strong></u> \ud83c\udf33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biome cards are the main source of resources each run. To start a new run you need to select which biomes you want to use. Explore them to find unique resources and customize your build the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Craft new resources</strong></u> \ud83d\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards to craft all kinds of new resources, equipment and structures to help you settle your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/ad51e0595bbcfd490eb14560a27508a4.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survive</strong></u> \ud83c\udf4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your people have a hunger meter. Establish a nice food production to keep that bar high, otherwise they will perish from starvation. \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight enemies</strong></u> \u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To start a new run you also need to select which dungeon/difficulty you want to play against. They will spawn all kinds of enemies in a wave based system, all depending on which difficulty you choose. Take them down, settle your people and unlock new cards to help you on your next run! All that while enjoying a soothing art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.poster.avif?t=1753106428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.webm?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488580/extras/c3599cc3d30b28830cc8349844e166f7.mp4?t=1753106428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
